aximize effectiveness in lawn care applications. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just starting out, this event is the perfect opportunity to gain valuable insights. Plus, enjoy a free lunch!&nbsp;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_self"><strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_blank">RSVP today &gt;</a></strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-450_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-451_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec 12, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-453_ pf-heading-1-h3">Liter House – Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-455_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in for a fun night at the ILA's Annual Meeting / Holiday Party featuring Live Music, Guest Comedian, and Raffle Prizes.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://ila.wildapricot.org/event-5927885" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-457_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-458_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">WNLA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec&nbsp;4, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-460_ pf-heading-1-h3">The Wisconsin Club – Milwaukee, WI</h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-462_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in&nbsp;for a fun evening of networking, celebrating award winners, dinner and drinks!&nbsp;<a href="https://wnla.net/meetinginfo.php?id=60&amp;ts=1728404774" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><