ref="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-701_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-702_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IGE Indiana Green Expo&nbsp;— January&nbsp;18 - 19, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-704_ pf-heading-1-h3">Indiana Convention Center in Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-706_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Indiana Green Expo 2024 two-day Trade Show provides opportunities for turf and landscape professionals to meet with vendors and view the newest products and technology. Plan to be a part of it! Visit Russo at Booth #118 &amp; Haltom at Booth #123.&nbsp;<a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-708_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-709_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA&nbsp;InVigorateU Conference&nbsp;— January&nbsp;16 - 17, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-711_ pf-heading-1-h3">DoubleTree by Hilton in Bloomington, IL</h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-713_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">InVigorateU is an annual education conference that not only offers great sessions and CEUs, but also offers a chance to reflect on what worked this season and collaborate with peers about what you might want to do differently in the next to get stronger results. Visit Russo at&nbsp;Booth #22.&nbsp;<a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/invigorateu/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-715_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-716_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Herbicide &amp; Weed Identification Workshop</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-718_ pf-heading-1-h3">Wednesday, December 13, 2023&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;Midwest Golf House in&nbsp;Lemont, IL<br>Cosponsored by the ILCA Turf Committee and Midwest Regional Turf Foundation<br></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-720_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">This half-day workshop offers training in weed identification, integrated weed management, selecting the right herbicides, enhancing weed control, and updates on the latest weed research findings.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/herbicide-weed-identification-workshop/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-722_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-723_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA's Pruning Workshop</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-725_ pf-heading-1-h3">Thursday, November&nbsp;2, 2023&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;NIU Naperville Conference Center in Naperville, IL</h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-727_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you want to learn how to prune according to professional standards or have minimal pruning proficiency and need to brush up on basic pruning specifics? This is the class for you! This half-day class is taught in Spanish in the morning and English in the afternoon.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/pruning-workshop/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-boZfnm bFakbT pf-729_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-730_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 4