icipal &amp; Landscape Expo — Novemeber 2-3, 2022</b></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-997_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Wisconsin State Fair Park, Milwaukee, WI<br></b><br>Formerly CONEX, this show features trailers, commercial mowing equipment, tree care products, snow &amp; ice control supplies, large equipment, and more!</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-bJBfJu jtyHnN pf-999_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-1003_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — October 12</b></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-1005_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Frankfort </b>- 21660 South La Grange Road, Frankfort, IL 60423, USA<br><br><b>Consign By:</b> 9/17   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 10/11 More Info &gt;</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-bJBfJu jtyHnN pf-1007_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-1011_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>ITEA Truck Safety Seminar — September 23</b></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-1013_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you drive a municipal or contractor vehicle, this seminar is essential for learning about truck safety. Learn about the best practices and get back on the road safely.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-bJBfJu jtyHnN pf-1015_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-1019_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — September 14</b></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-1021_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville</b> - 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL&nbsp;60030, USA<br><br><b>Consign By:</b> 8/20   |<b>   Preview Day:</b> 9/13</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-bJBfJu jtyHnN pf-1023_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-hoMrV bUmqXZ pf-1027_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>NATDA Trailer Show — August 31 - September 2</b></h3><p class="sc-ijaoyg iFFCUi pf-1029_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Music City Center in Nashville, TN<br><